SCOPE — what this licence does and does not cover.

The MIT licence above covers the ORIGINAL WORK in this repository: the analysis
code in scripts/, the results in results/, the pre-registered protocol and other
documentation, the manuscript in manuscript/, and the derived data tables in
data/ that were produced by this project (family_accessions.tsv,
adjudication_families.tsv, adjudication_counts_SEALED.tsv, harmonised_calls.tsv).

It does NOT cover, and cannot relicense, third-party material:

  sources/    Supplementary files downloaded from the publishers of the three
              source catalogues. These remain under their original terms and are
              redistributed here only to the extent those terms permit. Cite the
              original papers, not this repository, when using them:
                Tian et al. 2024, Microbiome    doi:10.1186/s40168-024-01876-z
                Zheng et al. 2022, ISME J       doi:10.1038/s41396-022-01188-w
                Yuan & Ju 2023, ES&T            doi:10.1021/acs.est.2c07800

  refs/       Text extracted from published papers for search and quotation.
              Copyright remains with the respective publishers.

  data/       Reference databases obtained from third parties (KEGG-derived
              files, Pfam-A.clans.tsv.gz, and similar) remain under the terms of
              their providers.

If you reuse the analysis, please cite the preprint and the archived Zenodo
release rather than the mutable GitHub URL.
